OL,3,AFour dead and thousands without power
OL,4,Aafter Hurricane Isaias lashes US
OL,5,
OL,6,FIsaias made landfall in Florida late on
OL,7,FFriday with maximum sustained winds of
OL,8,F105mph (168km/h) before being
OL,9,Fdowngraded to a post-tropical cyclone.
